      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "developer, he has built the platform's architecture, ensuring seamless content management and automation for broadcasters. | Core IP (code base, product roadmap, design system) and product leadership |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Rebecca Smith | SPEAK MPLS | Rebecca Smith, Co-Founder and"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Director of SPEAK MPLS, serves as a key strategic partner. With a background in media production, including roles at MTV and as CEO of BFRESH"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Productions, Rebecca has dedicated her career to empowering diverse voices in media. At SPEAK MPLS, she leads initiatives that provide training and"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "resources for content creators, making her an essential collaborator in shaping [Docket.tv](http://docket.tv/)'s accessibility and community-driven mission. | Anchor customer, real-world ops knowledge, ongoing QA, public-access network contacts |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Matthew Manning | GUMBO MEDIA | Gumbo Media, a"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "creative agency dedicated to amplifying Black voices and narratives, is also a partner in this initiative. Their expertise in brand storytelling and community"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "engagement supports [Docket.tv](http://docket.tv/)'s broader mission of creating a more inclusive and sustainable digital media ecosystem. As [Docket.tv](http://docket.tv/) scales, we aim to expand"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "the team with additional developers, growth strategists, and industry advisors to enhance platform capabilities and market adoption | Go-to-market planning, legal readiness, brand & partnership development |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Above is a listing details like name, LLC, about, and contribution. The previous message asked for some detailed information like LLC names and contributions, so now I need to verify what's in the image."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "So, it seems that the LLC is \"TURTLE LABS\", and Sample User is associated with it. From the info, Sample User is leading Docket.tv and has a focus on UX design and data solutions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Got it—here’s the updated partner snapshot"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| LLC (Owner) | Unique Assets & Strengths | Likely “Day-1” Contribution | JV Role |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **TURTLE LABS**  (Sample User) | - Full Docket.tv code base, roadmap, design system  - Deep product + UX leadership | - Assign/license platform IP - Continue as CTO / Product Director | **Chief Technology & Product** |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **SPEAK MPLS**  (Rebecca Smith) | - Established public-access station with hundreds of active producers  - Training programs & community trust  - Proof-of-concept workflows (all the SOP docs you shared) | - Serve as anchor customer & beta lab  - Supply real-world usage data + QA  - Promote adoption through public-access network | **Operations & Community Success** |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **GUMBO MEDIA**  (Matthew Manning) | - Award-winning creative agency focused on Black voices  - Brand storytelling & audience development  - Investor-facing pitch / deck expertise | - Lead go-to-market, PR, and partnerships  - Assemble funding narrative & handle pitch collateral  - Provide business-development staff | **Growth & Brand/Partnerships** |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*(Source: partner table + earlier internal docs)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Building the joint-venture in three quick moves"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Step | Why it matters | Concrete deliverable |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **1. Lock in the “inputs”** | Investors (and lawyers) need clear ownership of (a) code/IP, (b) brand, (c) customer contracts, (d) cash. | *Contribution & Equity Term Sheet*  – one pager stating exactly what each LLC contributes (cash $X or “sweat” @ $Y/hr caps), and the equity % they receive. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **2. Draft the Operating Agreement** | Defines governance, vesting, exits, IP ownership & license-back, profit distribution, dead-lock resolution, etc. | I can give you a bullet-perfect outline ready for counsel to fill in (§1 Formation, §2 Capital & Units, … §13 Dissolution). |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **3. Create a 12-month JV roadmap** | Shows investors a credible “use of proceeds” and lets each partner plan resourcing. | Joint Gantt or OKR sheet aligned to the 5 phases already in your manifesto (Platform → Creator → Viewer, Pilot, Full Launch). |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Sample cap-table scenarios (illustrative)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Scenario | TURTLE LABS | SPEAK MPLS | GUMBO MEDIA | Rationale |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Equal vote / unequal sweat** | 40 % | 30 % | 30 % | Useron front-loads IP; Rebecca & Matthew bring customers + GTM muscle. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Parity model** | 33⅓ % | 33⅓ % | 33⅓ % | Cultural “three-legs” approach—strong on mission, weaker on investor optics. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Founder-heavy** | 51 % | 24.5 % | 24.5 % | Keeps technical founder in control; others still meaningful owners. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Action: pick the target split now, even if you later tweak numbers after a valuation exercise."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Key clauses your counsel will want"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **IP Assignment & Royalty-Free License-Back** – TURTLE LABS assigns code but retains right to reuse generic components for consulting work."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Capital Calls vs. Sweat-Equity** – spell out hourly caps and convert un-met cash into additional units."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Governance** – 3-member board (one per LLC) with super-majority (≥ 2 votes) for raise/exit/IP sale."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Reverse Vesting / “Bad-Leaver”** – any partner who pulls out before X months forfeits un-vested units."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Exit & Tag/Drag** – protect minority LLCs if majority decides to sell."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. **Dissolution Priority** – IP reverts to TURTLE LABS if dissolved *and* investors paid."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What I need from you to finish the package"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Chosen equity split** (ballpark is fine)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Cash vs. sweat estimates** (e.g., Gumbo commits $50 k marketing spend; Speak MPLS devotes 100 hrs/mo staff time)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Preferred legal home** (Delaware LLC, Minnesota LLC, etc.)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Any **investor constraints** you already know (SAFE vs. priced round, board seat requirements)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Give me those four bullets, and I’ll deliver:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A polished *Contribution & Equity Term Sheet* (1 page)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A detailed Operating-Agreement outline (2-3 pages of headings & key language)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A 12-month joint road-map grid grouped by each partner’s swim-lane"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ready when you are!"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}